# Safety and Risk Rules

Never write code that guarantees, promises, targets, or forces fixed daily returns.

Forbidden claims:
- guaranteed returns
- daily profit guarantee
- 10% daily
- 30% daily
- 50% daily
- 70% daily
- risk-free
- no-loss strategy

The bot must:
- scan opportunities
- rank opportunities
- reject weak opportunities
- use probability estimates
- use liquidity filters
- use volatility filters
- use risk/reward filters
- require risk approval before execution

Every trade must pass:
- bot mode check
- live trading enabled check
- paper/live environment check
- PDT guard
- daily loss guard
- margin guard
- position size guard
- liquidity guard
- slippage guard
- spread guard
- manual approval check when required

Live trading must be disabled by default.

Never place orders unless:
- risk_approved == true
- execution_allowed == true
- kill_switch_active == false
